; error: 7:26: an 'each' over an iterator advances it: it gives no loop value and its end is a break, so a 'finally' never runs; gather what it gives with 'it.collect(r)', or use the iterator's other consumers
include std/collections

task main()
    region r
    flex nums: [int]@r = new [int]([1, 2, 3]) at r
    fixed doubled = each n in nums.take(2)
        n * 2
    fi
    show(doubled)
fi
